<section class="section-wrap section-block join-steps" data-reveal>
  <div><p class="eyebrow">How to join</p><h2>Owners and<br><em>people awaiting delivery.</em></h2>
    <p class="body-copy">The invite message welcomes recent buyers, people waiting for delivery and anyone who wants to connect with Duster owners. Older-generation Duster owners are welcome too.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ site.communityInvite }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WhatsApp invite <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps-list">
    <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Tap the invite</strong><p>Review WhatsApp’s community details before joining.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Say hello</strong><p>Share only what you’re comfortable sharing—your Duster, variant and general region are useful, not required.</p></div></li>
    <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Ask, learn, contribute</strong><p>Keep advice respectful, give context, and let others know when something is only your own experience.</p></div></li>
  </ol>
