    <p>Member experiences can help you ask better questions, but they aren’t professional diagnosis, official Renault guidance or a guarantee of an outcome. For safety concerns, warning lights, warranty questions or repairs, contact Renault or an authorized service centre. Please protect your privacy and never share sensitive personal or vehicle documents in public.</p>
